Third-party attribution and license preservation

The reverb delay tuning in audio_effects_dsp.py and web/audio_effects_dsp.js
is derived from STK FreeVerb tuning. The existing implementation notes in
docs/V2_1C_DSP_NOTES.md credit Perry R. Cook and Gary P. Scavone, and the STK
FreeVerb port by Gregory Burlet. This project uses its own deterministic
Python/browser renderer, rather than vendoring the STK library. The upstream
STK notice is reproduced below to preserve its terms:
https://github.com/thestk/stk/blob/master/LICENSE

