UI/parameter references; it states that their implementation source is not
vendored/copied. Preserve that provenance when redistributing this project.

docs/SEMANTIC_PRESETS.md and web/semantic_presets.js record MiniMax prompt-guide
references. This license grants no additional rights in MiniMax reference
material or other third-party content.

ComfyUI, MiniMax models, the optional Pedalboard host and user-installed VST3
plug-ins retain their own licenses. Screenshots may depict third-party plug-in
interfaces and marks; they are not a grant to redistribute those plug-ins.
